"""The dashboard page: one self-contained HTML document (no outside files, no tracking). Four places, bottom bar on a phone and top bar on a computer:
Home: what needs you, as plain cards with big Approve / Decline buttons (and "do this automatically from now on"), what is waiting, and what was done.
Connect: your connections and a + button to add more (Slack, Teams, Twilio, calendars, email, AI, tools, and your own apps by web address or webhook), the things the agent does, and going live.
Library: how complete your bundle is, missing lines sent to Speakvora (if you agree), updates.
Settings: ask-me-first switches, saved choices, phrase sharing, pause."""

